WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.900
World Masterpiece Theater

00:07.800 --> 00:14.400
Homeless Child Remy

00:07.800 --> 00:14.400
"About Love"

00:15.260 --> 00:23.200
I continue wishing to see you

00:23.690 --> 00:28.360
Today we'll go on a journey

00:28.450 --> 00:32.310
That's as endless as the blue sky

00:32.820 --> 00:40.990
With joy, sorrow and hope come setbacks

00:41.360 --> 00:46.040
They repeat, they repeat

00:46.280 --> 00:50.870
What should I believe?

00:51.510 --> 00:59.880
You know nothing about love, however

01:00.320 --> 01:08.900
Someday you will feel warmth inside

01:09.730 --> 01:19.860
I dream of the day when you'll speak of love

01:20.860 --> 01:28.660
Tomorrow, our journey will begin

01:29.510 --> 01:35.000
Presented by:
Takara Fansubs & Migoto

01:35.020 --> 01:39.600
Episode 17:
A Pledge in an Underground Maze

01:59.000 --> 02:01.530
Wow... They're beautiful.

02:02.410 --> 02:04.460
It's been getting warmer, hasn't it?

02:07.070 --> 02:09.640
Joli-Coeur loves the spring, don't you?

02:10.020 --> 02:12.970
Ah... Lise.

02:25.600 --> 02:28.050
Oooh! Ah, Remy!

02:28.050 --> 02:29.940
Lise, what are you doing?

02:30.360 --> 02:31.750
Come on, come on.

02:37.330 --> 02:40.110
Look! Cute, isn't it?

02:40.110 --> 02:42.770
Lise, where did you get that?

02:42.880 --> 02:45.260
Hehe, I took it with me.

02:45.860 --> 02:48.530
I've wanted this forever.

02:52.180 --> 02:56.040
Lise, stealing is not good. It's not a good thing.

02:56.550 --> 03:00.540
Why not? Big brother Mattia and big brother Ricardo both do it.

03:02.680 --> 03:05.560
That's what the boss forces them to do.

03:05.830 --> 03:10.680
Truthfully, stealing things from people is really not a good thing to do.

03:10.680 --> 03:11.740
Really?

03:11.850 --> 03:12.640
Yes.

03:13.590 --> 03:16.960
I think the people who had things stolen from them would feel sad... Probably...

03:17.270 --> 03:21.020
How about you, Lise? Wouldn't you feel sad if your lovely doll was stolen?

03:21.150 --> 03:23.290
I'd be sad.

03:25.180 --> 03:27.300
Then let's return the doll.

03:29.170 --> 03:30.030
Uhhh...

03:41.540 --> 03:43.780
I can never drop my guard with your kind around!

03:46.030 --> 03:47.930
Is this all that you've stolen?

03:48.260 --> 03:51.260
I've never stolen anything else. I'm sorry!

03:51.810 --> 03:52.640
What?!

03:54.140 --> 03:56.570
You said you didn't steal anything else?

03:56.740 --> 03:58.020
Don't mess with me!

03:58.680 --> 04:01.240
I will not forgive you!

04:03.420 --> 04:04.860
What's your problem?

04:08.270 --> 04:11.030
That was your punishment, now get out of here!

04:11.310 --> 04:14.750
If you do it again, I will take you to the police.

04:16.410 --> 04:18.520
I'm all right, Capi.

04:19.030 --> 04:24.080
What should I do? It's all my fault. What should I do?

04:27.450 --> 04:29.060
I'm fine, it's nothing.

04:32.560 --> 04:33.490
Lise?

04:34.110 --> 04:35.540
Where has she gone?

04:42.370 --> 04:45.080
Remy, I'm sorry, I'm sorry...

04:46.230 --> 04:47.550
Joli-Coeur?

04:49.450 --> 04:52.050
Joli-Coeur! Joli-Coeur!

04:53.440 --> 04:55.550
Joli-Coeur, where are you?

04:55.680 --> 04:58.620
Come out! You can't be in here!

05:07.500 --> 05:09.000
Joli-Coeur!

05:09.200 --> 05:10.980
Where are you?

05:11.180 --> 05:13.160
Joli-Coeur!

05:15.300 --> 05:16.820
Joli-Coeur!

05:26.370 --> 05:27.380
Lise?

05:29.120 --> 05:31.740
I don't know. She hasn't come around here.

05:32.800 --> 05:34.060
I haven't seen her.

05:34.120 --> 05:36.000
Me neither.
- Me neither.

05:36.000 --> 05:38.560
I see... Where has she gone?

05:38.670 --> 05:40.830
She wasn't in front of the church.

05:40.890 --> 05:42.320
Remy!

05:43.980 --> 05:47.720
I heard from Pierre that Lise has disappeared.

05:47.860 --> 05:48.560
Yes.

05:48.960 --> 05:50.460
Maybe she went home early.

05:50.830 --> 05:55.950
No... She wouldn't do that, she was still selling flowers.

05:56.320 --> 05:58.680
I wonder if she ran away...

05:59.120 --> 06:00.970
Why would she run away?

06:00.970 --> 06:04.890
Obviously she can't take being punished by the boss anymore.

06:05.140 --> 06:08.990
Marcel, where do you think a little girl would go?

06:09.350 --> 06:13.890
Of course, even if she runs away, the boss would go and find her.

06:14.590 --> 06:17.020
I will look for her harder.

06:17.080 --> 06:20.060
Lise disappeared because of me.

06:21.010 --> 06:22.860
Did something happen between you and Lise?

06:23.870 --> 06:24.710
Yes...

06:28.440 --> 06:31.720
Remy, I'll look for her with you.

06:33.200 --> 06:34.700
Thank you, Ricardo.

06:45.120 --> 06:46.620
Joli-Coeur...

06:51.400 --> 06:53.610
What happened?

07:00.420 --> 07:03.260
Oh yeah... I fell down.

07:04.280 --> 07:04.890
Oww!

07:12.120 --> 07:13.800
What should I do?

07:38.570 --> 07:40.620
No good... I can't reach.

07:41.040 --> 07:42.320
All right...

07:54.050 --> 07:59.620
Remy, we need to find Lise before our boss comes back, otherwise we're in trouble.

07:59.750 --> 08:00.610
Yeah...

08:05.680 --> 08:07.710
I said, don't follow me.

08:07.710 --> 08:11.720
We want to look for Lise, too.
- That's right.

08:11.900 --> 08:14.940
You guys, have you earned your money for today?

08:15.650 --> 08:17.760
No... Not yet.

08:18.030 --> 08:19.990
Me neither.
- Me neither.

08:20.580 --> 08:24.000
It's not just Lise who will receive Gaspard's punishment.

08:25.120 --> 08:28.520
Don't worry, I will find Lise for sure.

08:34.290 --> 08:38.660
Oww! I think I twisted my ankle.

08:39.520 --> 08:40.910
What should I do?

08:46.860 --> 08:48.800
What is it, Joli-Coeur?

08:49.570 --> 08:50.340
Oh...

09:25.850 --> 09:27.720
He's found her! He's found her!

09:37.180 --> 09:39.710
Is he saying Lise is here?
- Yes.

09:41.340 --> 09:42.840
Well, let's go.

09:43.940 --> 09:47.630
Lise, Joli-Coeur, come out!

09:47.630 --> 09:50.050
Lise, answer me!

09:52.170 --> 09:55.010
She isn't here.
- Capi doesn't make mistakes.

09:56.110 --> 09:59.790
Lise, if you are here, answer me!
Li- Woah!

10:00.630 --> 10:01.360
Ricardo!

10:01.450 --> 10:02.830
Remy!

10:02.900 --> 10:04.090
Let me help you.

10:04.620 --> 10:07.000
Woah!

10:26.950 --> 10:28.360
Oww...

10:29.280 --> 10:30.700
Shit!

10:30.890 --> 10:32.810
Are you all right, Ricardo?

10:32.810 --> 10:36.840
Yeah... Barely.
What a terrible accident.

10:36.840 --> 10:37.810
Yeah.

10:39.490 --> 10:41.250
Joli-Coeur's hat!

10:41.580 --> 10:44.340
Joli-Coeur and Lise have been here!

10:44.560 --> 10:47.050
All right, let's look for them!
- Yes.

10:49.190 --> 10:51.550
Lise! Joli-Coeur!

10:51.550 --> 10:54.500
Lise, where are you!?
- Ricardo, look at that!

10:56.840 --> 10:57.520
Wow...

11:04.950 --> 11:07.700
<i>Lise and Joli-Coeur went in here.</i>

11:22.360 --> 11:23.640
Have you seen Lise?

11:23.820 --> 11:26.970
Oh... I haven't seen her today.

11:27.450 --> 11:28.470
Capi...

11:33.760 --> 11:38.540
Lise! Joli-Coeur! Where are you?

11:39.970 --> 11:40.770
Ahh!!

11:40.770 --> 11:42.620
What's the matter?

11:43.060 --> 11:44.290
There's something there...

11:47.030 --> 11:49.010
Oh... It's just rats.

11:52.270 --> 11:53.700
Let's go, Ricardo.

11:55.180 --> 11:57.520
Are you saying Remy is down there?

12:00.870 --> 12:02.410
Oh! Capi!

12:15.280 --> 12:17.970
Remy... Which way should we go?

12:20.220 --> 12:24.580
Lise! Joli-Coeur!
If you are here, answer me!

12:27.450 --> 12:28.530
Let's go this way.

12:30.890 --> 12:33.580
Lise! Joli-Coeur!

12:34.020 --> 12:35.300
Remy!

12:35.720 --> 12:37.810
Lise! Where are you?

12:38.010 --> 12:39.750
Here! over here!

12:39.840 --> 12:41.640
Woah! Woah!

12:41.980 --> 12:43.140
Lise!

12:44.070 --> 12:45.790
Lise! Where are you?

12:46.820 --> 12:47.640
Remy!

12:50.590 --> 12:55.690
Lise... Thank goodness.
You're all right. I'm glad.

12:55.880 --> 12:59.500
I'm sorry, Remy. I'm sorry.

13:00.090 --> 13:04.150
Lise... You had us so worried.

13:04.280 --> 13:05.080
Sorry.

13:05.890 --> 13:07.570
But it's good you're all right.

13:09.480 --> 13:10.190
Oww!

13:10.480 --> 13:11.070
Lise?

13:11.670 --> 13:13.250
I twisted my ankle.

13:13.690 --> 13:15.390
That's not good.

13:15.630 --> 13:17.330
Okay. Let's go back now.

13:17.330 --> 13:19.360
I'll carry her on my back.
- Okay.

13:20.830 --> 13:22.030
Where is Joli-Coeur?

13:24.380 --> 13:25.510
He's gone somewhere.

13:25.930 --> 13:27.030
Huh?

13:30.470 --> 13:35.620
Joli-Coeur, where are you? Come here!

13:38.250 --> 13:41.360
Where could Joli-Coeur have gone?

13:41.600 --> 13:45.610
You guys go back now, Ricardo. I'll look for Joli-Coeur.

13:46.030 --> 13:47.370
What are talking about?

13:47.460 --> 13:49.330
I'll look for him, too.
- Me, too.

13:49.750 --> 13:50.720
But...

13:50.860 --> 13:52.530
Hey! Joli-Coeur!

13:52.620 --> 13:57.780
Joli-Coeur, where are you?
- Joli-Coeur, answer me!

14:03.020 --> 14:04.680
Let's go this way now.

14:07.920 --> 14:09.770
Capi!
- Big brother Mattia!

14:11.020 --> 14:12.150
Capi!

14:14.020 --> 14:15.630
You came here for us, Mattia.

14:16.120 --> 14:18.870
Heh. You got us in trouble.

14:19.690 --> 14:21.100
Are you all right, Lise?

14:21.160 --> 14:22.020
Yeah.

14:22.330 --> 14:23.740
Good. Let's go.

14:24.030 --> 14:25.130
Wait.

14:25.680 --> 14:27.620
I'm going to look for Joli-Coeur.

14:27.970 --> 14:29.630
You guys go back now.

14:30.020 --> 14:31.260
Capi, come on.

14:31.920 --> 14:32.620
Remy!

14:32.730 --> 14:34.500
I'll be back soon.

14:35.750 --> 14:38.400
We should go, too.
- Yeah.

14:38.530 --> 14:40.100
What's going on?

14:40.160 --> 14:42.170
Joli-Coeur hasn't been found yet.

14:44.110 --> 14:47.110
I'll go. You guys wait here.

14:57.050 --> 14:58.740
Big brother Ricardo...

14:59.180 --> 15:01.610
Shall we go, too?
- Yeah.

15:04.980 --> 15:06.810
Joli-Coeur!

15:09.760 --> 15:12.390
Mattia, are you going to look for him with me?

15:12.390 --> 15:15.170
I just want to finish this quickly
and go home.

15:22.240 --> 15:23.520
He's found him.

15:30.570 --> 15:32.860
I wonder how far they've gone.

15:34.190 --> 15:36.350
There? He's in there?

15:38.110 --> 15:40.120
Joli-Coeur, come here!

15:41.860 --> 15:43.330
Joli-Coeur!

15:44.110 --> 15:46.930
Hey, you had me so worried. That's not good, okay?

15:49.020 --> 15:51.970
I'm glad. I'm so glad.

15:54.600 --> 15:57.900
Lise... You're heavy for a little kid.

15:59.230 --> 16:01.760
Big brother Ricardo, walk faster.

16:02.140 --> 16:04.270
Be more considerate of me.

16:04.270 --> 16:06.060
Hurry up! Hurry up!

16:09.780 --> 16:13.290
Lise! Ricardo! Where are you?

16:14.460 --> 16:16.710
They were not there, either.
- I see.

16:17.190 --> 16:19.350
Crap! I told them to wait here.

16:19.350 --> 16:21.510
No good. Let's go back.

16:22.850 --> 16:25.430
Lise! Ricardo!

16:25.810 --> 16:28.060
Which way?

16:32.860 --> 16:33.680
He's found them!

16:35.460 --> 16:37.710
Big brother Ricardo, what's wrong?

16:37.710 --> 16:39.850
Huh? Nothing.

16:45.650 --> 16:47.410
Capi!
- Joli-Coeur!

16:48.310 --> 16:51.640
Ah! We're saved.
- Ricardo!

16:51.640 --> 16:53.050
Lise!
- Remy!

16:53.980 --> 16:56.670
Ah, I'm glad. We were worried.

16:56.760 --> 16:58.670
Sorry.

16:58.830 --> 17:01.410
We're gonna be late. Let's hurry for home.

17:06.320 --> 17:07.730
What's wrong, Mattia?

17:08.790 --> 17:11.480
I've lost the way back.
- What?

17:11.480 --> 17:13.480
We're lost?

17:18.070 --> 17:20.490
No good. This one is locked too.

17:25.450 --> 17:27.610
Even you can't figure it out.

17:28.980 --> 17:30.630
Big brother Mattia...

17:30.700 --> 17:33.650
It'll be all right. We'll find the exit for sure.

17:34.450 --> 17:36.670
Has Lise been found?

17:36.780 --> 17:40.950
It's almost time for the boss to come home.
- Yeah.

17:41.480 --> 17:44.500
I hope they make it back before then.

17:47.830 --> 17:52.040
The more we go on, the further we get into the maze...

17:53.620 --> 17:56.070
Lise. Hey, don't cry.

17:56.220 --> 18:01.650
Remy, I'm sorry. I will never steal from people again.

18:01.980 --> 18:04.050
I won't make you guys worried.

18:04.050 --> 18:05.080
Lise...

18:06.690 --> 18:08.740
Light! I see a light!

18:10.990 --> 18:12.670
We did it! An exit!

18:24.700 --> 18:26.710
W-what's that?

18:29.530 --> 18:32.660
Hey, somebody, help us!

18:32.660 --> 18:35.920
Help! Help!

18:40.350 --> 18:41.780
It's no use.

18:45.880 --> 18:47.580
Let's find another exit.

18:47.690 --> 18:48.730
Come on.

18:48.730 --> 18:52.430
Don't order me around!
You made us walk all the way up here!

18:53.160 --> 18:55.340
It's your fault for wandering around!

18:55.340 --> 18:57.590
Are you saying it's my fault we got lost?

18:57.810 --> 18:59.170
You wanna fight?

18:59.170 --> 19:02.220
Stop! This is no time to fight!

19:02.900 --> 19:07.590
You're right. Okay, I'll stop for Remy.

19:07.730 --> 19:10.570
Huh! Because you like Remy, right?

19:10.700 --> 19:14.690
W-what? You still wanna fight?
- Stop!

19:16.540 --> 19:18.170
Don't fight!

19:18.790 --> 19:24.190
It's my fault. Remy got scolded because I stole the doll.

19:24.610 --> 19:28.690
And then I got you guys into trouble. What Remy told me is right.

19:29.590 --> 19:31.400
What did you say to Lise?

19:31.510 --> 19:34.930
I told her stealing is not a good thing to do.
- Is that all?

19:35.080 --> 19:37.950
Don't say that! It's important!

19:38.870 --> 19:40.700
What Remy's saying is right!

19:41.080 --> 19:45.240
I've changed my mind about stealing, it's wrong.

19:45.350 --> 19:46.700
I don't want to do it anymore.

19:47.070 --> 19:48.480
It can't be helped!

19:48.480 --> 19:52.450
If we don't, we will be punished by Gaspard! You know that, too!

19:52.540 --> 19:53.290
But...

19:53.640 --> 19:56.840
If we work together,
we can work around it.

19:57.100 --> 20:00.830
Instead of stealing, we've got to work or run away.

20:00.830 --> 20:02.500
Run away?
- Yeah.

20:02.940 --> 20:03.800
Heh.

20:05.030 --> 20:07.260
I'll go and look for an exit.

20:07.920 --> 20:09.180
Remy...

20:09.640 --> 20:13.060
Mattia and I tried to run away once.

20:14.420 --> 20:20.050
When the boss told us to steal for the first time, we escaped from the house.

20:20.490 --> 20:21.700
But we were brought back.

20:21.760 --> 20:25.690
Now the boss will punish everyone even if just one of us tries to escape.

20:26.720 --> 20:29.550
So no one can escape.

20:33.620 --> 20:34.680
Mattia...

20:36.510 --> 20:39.600
Everyone is worrying, aren’t they?

20:41.800 --> 20:46.250
If we don't go home, the rest of us will be punished, won't they?

20:47.530 --> 20:49.960
Well, let's find an exit.

20:56.460 --> 21:02.850
It's not Ricardo or Lise's fault that we got lost. It's mine for forgetting the way back.

21:02.850 --> 21:05.630
No... It's not your fault.

21:06.990 --> 21:10.520
Mattia, don't lose hope. Don't give up.

21:10.520 --> 21:13.120
If you keep moving forward, you'll find the way to go.

21:19.540 --> 21:22.270
Ah! Joli-Coeur, come back!

21:22.600 --> 21:25.180
Oh! An exit.

21:25.180 --> 21:27.470
I'll go get Ricardo and Lise.

21:38.010 --> 21:41.490
<i>Maybe I'll be able to find...</i>

21:41.890 --> 21:50.370
Try to love yourself more

21:42.990 --> 21:44.490
<i>my own way.</i>

21:51.520 --> 22:00.910
Abandoned dreams can be seen again

22:01.090 --> 22:09.590
Surely, not everyone can be so strong

22:10.700 --> 22:21.520
The blue sky lifts all of the world's tears...

22:22.050 --> 22:31.750
Tomorrow's courage comes

22:31.900 --> 22:41.770
From the future that gives us our fate

22:41.910 --> 22:50.570
Try to seek for them more

22:51.490 --> 22:55.240
Give your heart to

22:55.400 --> 23:11.270
That person who is also seeking you

23:19.220 --> 23:22.480
I wonder if I will meet my real mother someday.

23:25.880 --> 23:28.720
Give it back! It's my pendant!

23:29.380 --> 23:31.560
Stop! Let go of Remy!

23:33.120 --> 23:36.940
<i>A Mother and Child's Close Encounter</i>

23:33.120 --> 23:36.940
Next time:
